This package vendors and adapts the "edu-solid-geometry" skill from the
edulab project.

Upstream source : https://github.com/wy51ai/edulab
Skill path      : skills/edu-solid-geometry
License         : Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE.upstream)
Author          : wy51ai (edulab)

Faithfully vendored (unmodified in behavior):
  - geometry_kernel.py       (lib/geometry_kernel.py)
  - bodies.py                (lib/bodies.py)
  - template_lesson.html     (template/lesson.html)

Added for backend integration (original work, same Apache-2.0 terms):
  - render.py    : render lesson_data into the template, returning an HTML
                   string (no filesystem write, no cwd dependency).
  - driver.py    : a generic, deterministic `problem spec -> lesson_data`
                   builder on top of geometry_kernel + bodies (upstream only
                   ships per-problem example builders in scripts/generate.py).
  - extract.py   : solid-geometry detection + AI structured extraction of a
                   problem spec from lesson content.

The upstream Apache-2.0 license text is retained in LICENSE.upstream.
